{"id":"m9zWxNV31eSjE8h","name":"ayudantes_dialogos","type":"sequence","entries":[{"id":"78E9kcE3oEJJ8X1","name":"ayudante_interaccion","triggers":["0BFn7BwpkZ01BZG","vuAiSDMK2xTY2xA","6bznBRkirAgsXOh","u4rEE7naW8mHDKw","3OaWDyyIdYxWDsU"],"definition":"FTFoOxtzHq8STZH","shiftType":"ANY","interactionType":"RIGHT_CLICK","type":"entity_interact_event","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"vuAiSDMK2xTY2xA","name":"ayudante_particulas","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"location":{"enabled":false,"value":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"particle":"HAPPY_VILLAGER","count":12,"offset":{"x":0.4,"y":0.5,"z":0.4},"speed":0.02,"type":"spawn_particles","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"6bznBRkirAgsXOh","name":"ayudante_sonido","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"entity.villager.yes"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.7,"pitch":1.3},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"yl9F6sn23DSp8kV","name":"ayudante_sonido_respuesta","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"block.note_block.chime"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.6,"pitch":1.5},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"u4rEE7naW8mHDKw","name":"ayudante_opciones","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"FTFoOxtzHq8STZH","text":"¡Hola! Soy Wren. ¿En qué te ayudo?","options":[{"text":"¿Cómo creo una home?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["zjliKE1QufhQNB9"]},{"text":"¿Cómo consigo dinero?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["reosfhypnXLDn8S"]},{"text":"¿Qué son los Shards?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["9wPNWkPLR347A7T"]},{"text":"¿Cómo protejo mi casa?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["PdoE2u6Qe1NBPBT"]},{"text":"<#7FD8FF>Abrir el Menú Principal","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["rbEpvpDbnIIAp00"]},{"text":"<#FFD36B>Ver la Guía de Ayuda","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["bbStdd8AgdmX2sa"]}],"duration":1000,"type":"option","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"zjliKE1QufhQNB9","name":"ayudante_homes","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["yl9F6sn23DSp8kV"],"speaker":"FTFoOxtzHq8STZH","text":"Guarda tu posición con <yellow>/sethome <nombre></yellow>. Luego vuelve con <yellow>/home <nombre></yellow> y mira todas con <yellow>/homes</yellow>. También están en Menú Principal › Más Opciones › Mis Homes.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"reosfhypnXLDn8S","name":"ayudante_dinero","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["yl9F6sn23DSp8kV"],"speaker":"FTFoOxtzHq8STZH","text":"La forma más fácil —un trabajo con <yellow>/jobs</yellow>—: minero, leñador, pescador… cobras por cada acción. También puedes vender en la Tienda, ganar minijuegos, subastar objetos y cazar buscados del bounty.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"9wPNWkPLR347A7T","name":"ayudante_shards","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["yl9F6sn23DSp8kV"],"speaker":"FTFoOxtzHq8STZH","text":"Los <#D89BFF>Shards</#D89BFF> son la moneda especial: con ellos compras cosméticos, mascotas y partículas. Se ganan en eventos, recompensas y el Pase de Batalla. Mira cuántos tienes en el scoreboard.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"PdoE2u6Qe1NBPBT","name":"ayudante_protecciones","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["yl9F6sn23DSp8kV"],"speaker":"FTFoOxtzHq8STZH","text":"Para que nadie rompa tu casa usa <yellow>/nclaim</yellow> o Menú Principal › Protecciones. Colocas el bloque de protección y el chunk queda a tu nombre; luego puedes añadir amigos.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"rbEpvpDbnIIAp00","name":"ayudante_menu","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["yl9F6sn23DSp8kV","zKLMcyKHKi7M07Q"],"speaker":"FTFoOxtzHq8STZH","text":"Todo está en el libro de tu inventario: el Menú Principal. Desde ahí llegas a trabajos, mascotas, tienda, perfil y mucho más. Te lo abro ahora.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"zKLMcyKHKi7M07Q","name":"ayudante_abrir_menu","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"core-menu menuMain %player_name%","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"bbStdd8AgdmX2sa","name":"ayudante_abrir_ayuda","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"core-menu menuAyuda %player_name%","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"3OaWDyyIdYxWDsU","name":"ayudante_tutorial","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":">=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":5}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"FTFoOxtzHq8STZH","text":"Primero termina el tutorial: sigue el rastro blanco. Si ya conoces el servidor, escribe <yellow>/saltar</yellow>.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"8WEXJC7ZcRZCh96","name":"cronista_interaccion","triggers":["0BFn7BwpkZ01BZG","hpwdmnu4LEqCI9j","sl6OUmbXzY3eXwY","4gDKbaEgXwZfQ1c","SD652OvHjHFFbp4"],"definition":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","shiftType":"ANY","interactionType":"RIGHT_CLICK","type":"entity_interact_event","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"hpwdmnu4LEqCI9j","name":"cronista_particulas","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"location":{"enabled":false,"value":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"particle":"ENCHANT","count":30,"offset":{"x":0.5,"y":0.8,"z":0.5},"speed":0.6,"type":"spawn_particles","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"sl6OUmbXzY3eXwY","name":"cronista_sonido","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"item.book.page_turn"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.9,"pitch":0.9},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"SPbFclphD1Cu5Lr","name":"cronista_sonido_historia","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"block.enchantment_table.use"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.6,"pitch":0.8},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"4gDKbaEgXwZfQ1c","name":"cronista_opciones","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"Ah… otro que despierta. ¿Qué quieres saber?","options":[{"text":"No sé qué hacer… ¿cuál es mi próximo paso?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["Itsjk5inSjV5o3B","DqGsC5IHra8mGXw","5zMRl5frPi9NeFs","FW5BVI18Ao4eSfi","67KClDVwQB9e6k8","IVB70u4ESKaWXfh","xWAdJriqR12CWgB","6woWVgrXlkXKHN2","oIyMtgd3cG98qSv","cwzaCtlmHAfcZWN","DlHBKoOg6i9NEft","aKQeEK2RttxbnaB","A0f5gfue08DjDRO","iGU1poNce4BqKSx","cgAYJdv7n1EANSP","wgnIVbZYQbDGp64","tZ3ltxUykdwEqDF","E262Z1DZyGALkW5","etIoB2N4LpTDNLB","qPtC8OB3o00jvD4"]},{"text":"Cuéntame la historia del reino","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["H9lMnFDOpdJvarw"]},{"text":"¿Quién eres?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["wmSwk81zG4ExeBt"]},{"text":"<#E0C28A>Ver mi historia (/historia)","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["876IroUSqJog95a"]},{"text":"<#E0C28A>✦ Mis crónicas se borran…","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":11}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["49JdoF3FQYIo7zb"]},{"text":"<#E0C28A>✦ Entregar libros y tinta","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":12},{"fact":"huSMxy3ZnwiWfoR","operator":">=","value":6},{"fact":"BdOqrgIE7O0EISe","operator":">=","value":10}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["Icw4Sj2BfzIlbDV"]},{"text":"Sobre las crónicas…","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":12}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["uPXJSCt0U1LwZsq"]},{"text":"He perdido la Crónica Restaurada…","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":15},{"fact":"O6vPcgKXIu9FimN","operator":"==","value":0}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["5r1hnmxc6jUbDJg"]},{"text":"<#FFD36B>✦ ¿Qué palabra grabó el clan de Brom en la corona?","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":2}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["OPblpKpbdyWoTA8"]},{"text":"<#E0C28A>✦ Cuéntame lo que viví","criteria":[{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":16}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["DecFdaRofCXxG5P"]}],"duration":1000,"type":"option","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"H9lMnFDOpdJvarw","name":"cronista_historia_1","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["QQHGJIyU65YKtzr","SPbFclphD1Cu5Lr"],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"Hace siglos este fue el Imperio de Draemir, un reino próspero. El Rey quiso vivir para siempre y bebió de una raíz que crecía bajo su trono. Así nació la Maleza.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"QQHGJIyU65YKtzr","name":"cronista_historia_2","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["D9bG56ToaA2iiI4"],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"La Maleza se alimenta de recuerdos. Quien muere en estas tierras vuelve a levantarse —sí—, pero cada vez con menos de sí mismo. Has revivido más veces de las que imaginas.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"D9bG56ToaA2iiI4","name":"cronista_historia_3","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"Por eso escribo. Cada vez que vuelves, te leo lo que hiciste. Algún día, quizá, recuerdes por tu cuenta… y la Maleza pierda su poder sobre ti.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"wmSwk81zG4ExeBt","name":"cronista_quien","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"Soy Aldric, el último cronista del Imperio. No recuerdo mi propia vida —pero recuerdo todas las tuyas. Están aquí, en este libro.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"876IroUSqJog95a","name":"cronista_abrir_historia","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"historia","sudo":false,"type":"player_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"SD652OvHjHFFbp4","name":"cronista_tutorial","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":">=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":5}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"Todavía no es momento de mis historias. Termina tu despertar: sigue el rastro blanco.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"Itsjk5inSjV5o3B","name":"cronista_paso_tutorial","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":">=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":5}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"Aún estás despertando. Sigue el rastro blanco y termina lo que empezaste con el Rey.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"DqGsC5IHra8mGXw","name":"cronista_paso_herrero","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":5},{"fact":"8HlrwYMfvea9lkx","operator":"==","value":0}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"Busca a Brom el Herrero, en el camino principal. Fue el primero en sobrevivir a la Maleza.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"5zMRl5frPi9NeFs","name":"cronista_paso_chamana","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":5},{"fact":"8HlrwYMfvea9lkx","operator":"==","value":1},{"fact":"wkkMxzwwM5hpA6e","operator":"==","value":0}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"Malvor el Chamán escucha los ecos de la Maleza. Habla con él: te mostrará algo que necesitas ver.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"FW5BVI18Ao4eSfi","name":"cronista_paso_granjero","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":5},{"fact":"8HlrwYMfvea9lkx","operator":"==","value":1},{"fact":"wkkMxzwwM5hpA6e","operator":"==","value":1},{"fact":"EfujfoRnxa6wHW3","operator":"==","value":0}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"Te falta Tobías el Granjero. Sin comida no llegarás lejos ahí fuera.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"67KClDVwQB9e6k8","name":"cronista_paso_libre","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":5},{"fact":"5PBbnm3NliqNT1N","operator":"==","value":1},{"fact":"KPiLyCJNOKjip5B","operator":"==","value":16}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"VnSOgsR8uQYuY8C","text":"Ya has terminado el Capítulo 1. Fortalécete —consigue un trabajo, protege tu casa y prepárate. El Alquimista no ha dicho su última palabra.","duration":2000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null}],"chapter":"npc.ayudantes","priority":0,"version":"0.8.0"}